<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/brand-assets/logo_reply-ai_thumbnail.svg">
    <title>reply-AI - Automatiza tu MercadoLibre con IA</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-900 min-h-screen flex flex-col">
    <!-- Navegación -->
    <nav class="max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto p-6 flex justify-between items-center">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <img src="/brand-assets/logo_reply-ai.png" alt="reply-AI" class="h-10">
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
            <%# <a href="/app/login" class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition">Iniciar Sesión</a>
            <a href="/signup" class="bg-gray-900 text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold hover:bg-gray-800 transition shadow-lg">
                Probar Gratis
            </a> %>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <main class="flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center max-w-5xl w-full mx-auto text-center px-6 pb-24">
        <span class="inline-block mb-6 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-blue-600 uppercase">
            Inteligencia artificial para eCommerce
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-6xl font-black leading-tight mb-8 tracking-tighter text-[#0f172a]">
            Potenciá tu atención en<br>
            <span class="text-[#ff5000]">Mercado Libre</span> con<br>
            Inteligencia Artificial
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
            Reply AI combina inteligencia artificial y conocimiento del eCommerce para ayudarte a responder consultas pre-venta con mayor rapidez, consistencia y eficiencia.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base text-gray-400 mt-4 mb-12">
            Una solución impulsada por Reply.
        </p>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
            <a href="/signup" class="bg-[#ff5000] text-white px-10 py-5 rounded-2xl font-black text-xl hover:bg-[#e64800] transition transform hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-xl shadow-orange-200">
                Conectar cuenta
            </a>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>